    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/cloud-kitchen/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Cloud Kitchen is a delectable theme tailored for the rapidly growing cloud kitchen, virtual restaurant, delivery-only food business, ghost kitchen, and dark kitchen industry. Designed for businesses offering online food delivery, meal prep services, and multi-brand virtual kitchens, this theme provides a seamless platform to manage and showcase your cloud kitchen operations. Whether launching a single-brand kitchen, scaling a multi-brand virtual restaurant, or managing an online restaurant business, it includes essential tools for success. Built with a powerful Restaurant Menu &amp; Ordering plugin, it supports menu display, online order management, and integration with popular delivery apps, simplifying logistics and ensuring smooth operations. Its clean, modern, and fully responsive design highlights food offerings, strengthens cloud kitchen branding, and features customizable banners, menu optimization options, delivery tracking, and virtual kitchen management tools. Optimized for SEO, mobile devices, and performance, the Cloud Kitchen theme provides a professional, efficient, and visually appealing platform for virtual kitchens, food delivery startups, and online restaurant ventures, helping attract customers and boost online orders."
    },
